Class AIRunSummarySchema:
- lightweight metadata for one ai_run row, including provider usage counters and cost

Class AIRunCreateRequest:
- generic POST /ai/runs request shape
- includes MatchContext, ResponsePreferences, stream flag, session_id, operation_context

Class AIRunPayload:
- wrap AIRunSummarySchema plus optional structured result

Class LLMLogClearPayload:
- summarize debug-log cleanup results for the local tooling endpoint
- report whether any logs existed, total bytes removed, how many files were deleted, and which log directory was targeted
